  "bodyHash": "wMFymzy2xKI=",
  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/HKSjwdn/Living-Things.jpg\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1125\" height=\"633\" />\n<br /><br />\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\">\n    為 Minecraft 新增多種生物，讓世界更有生機\n</h3>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n遊戲內關於生物/物品的詳細資訊由 <strong>Patchouli</strong>（作者：Vazkii）提供&nbsp;\n<a title=\"點此下載\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/patchouli\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    點此下載\n</a>\n<br />\n（非必要但<strong>強烈推薦</strong>）\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n\n此模組支援 Forge、Fabric（自 1.18.2 版起）以及 NeoForge（自 1.20.4 版起）。\n<br />\n<small>請查看版本頁籤以了解模組的所有版本。</small>\n<br />\n<small>Fabric 版需安裝 Fabric-API </small>\n<a title=\"此處取得\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">此處取得</a>\n\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n生物/物品的詳細資訊可在 <strong>Wiki</strong> 中找到&nbsp;\n<a title=\"GitHub\" href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">點我前往</a>\n<br />\n<br />\n<table>\n    <thead align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"5\"><b>目前已新增的生物（遊戲內圖片請見圖庫）</b></td>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody align=\"center\">\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\">大象</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\">長頸鹿</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\">獅子</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\">鯊魚</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\">企鵝</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Elephant\" alt=\"大象\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FmTrk3V/x150-elephant.png\" alt=\"大象\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Giraffe\" alt=\"長頸鹿\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/zSqZdg1/x150-giraffe-1.png\" alt=\"長頸鹿\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Lion\" alt=\"獅子\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Gc5Gv7H/x150-lion.png\" alt=\"獅子\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shark\" alt=\"鯊魚\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/TT37Srs/x150-shark.png\" alt=\"鯊魚\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Penguin\" alt=\"企鵝\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3Nsz7QJ/x150-penguin.png\" alt=\"企鵝\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\">鴕鳥</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\">紅鶴</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\">蝠鱝</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\">浣熊</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ostrich\" alt=\"鴕鳥\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Hp3pSkb/x150-ostrich.png\" alt=\"鴕鳥\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Flamingo\" alt=\"紅鶴\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cD25F5X/x150-flamingo.png\" alt=\"紅鶴\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Crab\" alt=\"螃蟹\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4jBC2W6/x150-crab-red.png\" alt=\"螃蟹\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Mantaray\" alt=\"蝠鱝\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yFdCLY5/x150-mantaray-blue.png\" alt=\"蝠鱝\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Raccoon\" alt=\"浣熊\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/603nvTx/x150-raccoon.png\" alt=\"浣熊\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\">貓頭鷹</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\">遠古烈焰使者</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\">無尾熊</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\">蝸牛</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\">猴子</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Owl\" alt=\"貓頭鷹\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PYjzN6N/x150-owl-brown.png\" alt=\"貓頭鷹\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Ancient-Blaze\" alt=\"遠古烈焰使者\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KmFhmKP/x150-ancient-blaze.png\" alt=\"遠古烈焰使者\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Koala\" alt=\"無尾熊\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/7bjDt6t/x150-koala.png\" alt=\"無尾熊\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Snail\" alt=\"蝸牛\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3TbdjV6/x150-snail-blue.png\" alt=\"蝸牛\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Monkey\" alt=\"猴子\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FDhLcWf/x150-monkey.png\" alt=\"猴子\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\">地獄騎士</a></b>\n            </td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\">蘑菇精靈</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\">海馬</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\">幼年終界龍</a></b></td>\n            <td><b><a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\">孔雀</a></b></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Nether-Knight\" alt=\"地獄騎士\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mChdgsc/x150-nether-knight.png\" alt=\"地獄騎士\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Shroomie\" alt=\"蘑菇精靈\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wRHq7bv/x150-shroomie-red.png\" alt=\"蘑菇精靈\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Seahorse\" alt=\"海馬\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4Ty45xG/x150-seahorse-blue.png\" alt=\"海馬\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Baby-Enderdragon\" alt=\"幼年終界龍\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nQdkC9g/x150-baby-ender-dragon.png\" alt=\"幼年終界龍\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n            <td>\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/tristankechlo/Living-Things/wiki/Peacock\" alt=\"孔雀\">\n                    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/GpKcwTn/x150-peacock.png\" alt=\"孔雀\">\n                </a>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<br />\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/pzC0Why/divider-blue.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"1000\" height=\"10\" /></p>\n<br />\n如果你對模組有任何疑問，或想了解更多關於未來功能的資訊：\n<br>\n歡迎加入 Discord &nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n    <img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/VQ66pHN/Discord.png\" alt=\"分隔線\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\" />\n</a>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a title=\"Discord\" href=\"https://discord.gg/bhUaWhq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">連結</a>",
